# room_concept wall panel — 2 triangles, resized when drawn.
# Local x = ALONG the wall (scaled by width_m), z = height (scaled by height_m),
# y = the wall normal, zero thickness. Unit-box convention: x in [-0.5,0.5], z in [0,1].
v -0.500000 0.000000 0.000000
v 0.500000 0.000000 0.000000
v 0.500000 0.000000 1.000000
v -0.500000 0.000000 1.000000
vt 0.000000 0.000000
vt 1.000000 0.000000
vt 1.000000 1.000000
vt 0.000000 1.000000
f 1/1 2/2 3/3
f 1/1 3/3 4/4
